   "body_md": "## The recordings\n\n- **ween1996-04-29** (recommended): source not stated; 9 songs; 33 min; rated 3/5 by 2 [1]. Said about its sound: Reviewer finds the recording merely decent, not spectacular [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Ween opened for Foo Fighters, after Jawbreaker; Ween played as just Aaron and Mickey, with no other band members [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween1996-04-29**: taped by Ted Mattes; transferred by Kobi Stapleton+Chris King; source: Schoeps MK4 > R-Mod Power Supply > Sony TCD-100 [1]. Also: Master DAT went via Tascam DA-16 and a modded MOTU Ultralite into WaveLab, then Audacity, Amadeus Pro and xACT [1]",
